nst it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every vessel is uniquely yours. Assemble each unit from individual parts, each with its own stats and mechanics. The look of your starship isn't just for show; if it looks like a death machine, it probably is. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024370/extras/9149cfb6121491868e37863a1651f631.poster.avif?t=1777715913\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024370/extras/9149cfb6121491868e37863a1651f631.webm?t=1777715913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024370/extras/9149cfb6121491868e37863a1651f631.mp4?t=1777715913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Lead a paramilitary force against a growing space Cult threat. Program your units, build a fleet, trade, research, and engage in deep tactical combat in this RPG-strategy hybrid.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024370/995f61571a4e83da406a84bc6cc85f36420bf527/header.jpg?t=1777715913", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024370/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1777715913", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3024370/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1777715913", "website": "https://NebuLeet.github.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any processor with 2-4 cores, e.g. Intel gen6-7 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics: